warning[needless_bool]: this `ifx` turns a condition into the same `bool`
  --> tests/lint/needless_bool/bad.jai:37:13
   |
37 |     even := ifx n % 2 == 0 then true else false;
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `n % 2 == 0`
   |
36       n := 5;
37 ~     even := n % 2 == 0;
38       odd := ifx even then false else true;
   |
   = note: `needless_bool` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/needless_bool

warning[needless_bool]: this `ifx` turns a condition into the same `bool`
  --> tests/lint/needless_bool/bad.jai:38:12
   |
38 |     odd := ifx even then false else true;
   |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `!even`
